{
  "about": "Planned requests of the CLI planner (internal/plan) and of the browser page (web/js/plan.js), which runs only the key checks. Both read this file; neither may change a range without changing it here. length is the representation length used to place offsets; remote says whether the server reported it (false: taken from the reference file).",
